    <string name="planning_guide_assumptions">Available funds are your own estimate. Enter only savings and older or untracked bills that are still to be deducted. Paid markers are not bank confirmation. This guide includes current overdue bills and bills due through the next income date. It counts today and excludes income day. The daily amount rounds down to cents. The estimated income date is not guaranteed.</string>
    <string name="planning_simulation_intro">Enter the monthly savings baseline first. The signed adjustment excludes any category cuts below. The first hypothetical contribution is at the end of next month. This estimate does not save anything or guarantee a date.</string>
